cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Baseline Rubberized Concrete Dataset - Pillar 1: Material Characterization & Mixture Design"
abstract: "Comprehensive baseline characterization dataset for rubberized concrete mixtures (0%, 5%, 10%, 15% rubber replacement) including mechanical properties, microstructure, thermal properties, and durability indicators. This dataset establishes the ambient temperature baseline for developing thermo-mechanical models of fire-resistant structural elements utilizing high-performance rubberized concrete."
