  year: 2025
  abstract: "Comprehensive baseline characterization dataset for rubberized concrete mixtures including mechanical properties, microstructure, thermal properties, and durability indicators at ambient temperature (23°C). The dataset covers four mix designs with rubber replacement levels of 0%, 5%, 10%, and 15% by volume of fine aggregate, establishing the foundation for thermo-mechanical modeling of fire-resistant structural elements."
